@baseUrl = http://localhost:6001
@consentTargetId = 456
@rorId = 029pk6x14

### List consent targets with a ROR. Each data item has consentTargetId,
### consentController (organizationName and ROR), and consentPurpose (codeLabel and codeValue).
### consent contains the signed-in user's active consent dates, or {} if there is no active consent.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consent/targets

### Find consent targets by bare ROR ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consent/targets?rorId={{rorId}}

### List each ROR-identified target covered by my active consents.
### Each data item also contains consent dates in a consent object.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/consent

### Grant consent for a target
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/consent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "consentTargetId": {{consentTargetId}}
}

### Withdraw consent using a consent target ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/consent/{{consentTargetId}}

### Attempt to grant consent to a missing target
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/consent
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "consentTargetId": 2147483647
}

### Attempt to withdraw consent that is not mine
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/consent/2147483647
